    "intro_narrative": "You stand in the sleek, dimly lit office of the 'Shadow Broker,' an elusive financial criminal known for laundering money through complex digital channels. The air is cold, humming with the sound of server racks hidden behind mahogany panels. You have infiltrated this secure facility with one goal: open the Master Vault and secure the ledger that proves the syndicate's guilt. The room is filled with specialized cryptographic tools and security devices. You must decipher the flow of data, decrypt the security protocols, and bypass the biometric locks before the security team arrives. Every device here is part of a larger puzzle; understanding how they connect is the key to your success.",
